{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2th-1-intro","title":"2 Thessalonians 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>Wherefore. 5:11,14; Isa 40:1,2; Lu 21:28; Heb 12:12 comfort. or, exhort. Heb 10:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-1","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Paul certifies them of the good opinion which he had of their faith, love, and patience; 11 and therewithal uses divers reasons for the comforting of them in persecution, whereof the chief is taken from the righteous judgment of God.</p>\n<p>2Co 1:19; 1Th 1:1-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-2","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Ro 1:7; 1Co 1:3,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-3","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>are. 2:13; Ro 1:8; 1Co 1:4; 1Th 1:2,3; 3:6,9 as is. Lu 15:32; Php 1:7; 2Pe 1:13 your. Job 17:9; Ps 84:7; 92:13; Pr 4:18; Isa 40:29-31; Lu 17:5; Joh 15:2 Php 1:9; 1Th 4:1,9,10; 1Pe 1:22; 2Pe 1:5-10; 3:18 groweth.The word, [huperauxano ,] from [huper ,] intensive, and [auxano ,] to grow, increase, signifies, as Dr. Clarke remarks, to grow luxuriantly, as a good and healthy tree in a good soil; and, if a fruit tree, bearing an abundance of fruit to compensate the labour of the husbandman. Faith is one of the seeds of the kingdom: this the Apostle had sowed and watered, and God gave an abundant increase. Their faith was multiplied, and their love abounded: and this was not the case with some distinguished characters only; it was the case with every one of them. For this the apostle felt himself bound to give continual thanks to God on their behalf, as it was \"meet\" and right.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-4","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>glory. 2Co 7:14; 9:2,4; 1Th 2:19 your patience. 3:5; Ro 2:7; 5:3-5; 8:25; 12:12; 1Th 1:3; 3:2-8; Heb 6:15; 10:36 Heb 12:1-3; Jas 1:3,4; 5:7,8; 2Pe 1:6; Re 14:12 your persecutions. 1Th 2:14; 3:3,4; Jas 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-5","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>manifest. 6; Php 1:28; 1Pe 4:14-18 righteous. Job 8:3; Ps 9:7,8; 33:5; 50:6; 72:2; 99:4; 111:7; Jer 9:24; Da 4:37 Ro 2:5; Re 15:4; 16:7; 19:2 may. 11; Lu 20:35; 21:36; Ac 13:46; Eph 4:1; Col 1:12; Re 3:4 for. 7; Ac 14:22; Ro 8:17; 1Th 2:14; 2Ti 2:12; Heb 10:32,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-6","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>De 32:41-43; Ps 74:22,23; 79:10-12; 94:20-23; Isa 49:26; Zec 2:8 Re 6:10; 11:18; 15:4; 16:5,6; 18:20,24; 19:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-7","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>who. Isa 57:2; Mt 5:10-12; Lu 16:25; Ro 8:17; 2Co 4:17; 2Ti 2:12 Heb 4:1,9,11; 1Pe 4:1; Re 7:14-17; 14:13; 21:4 when. Mt 13:39-43; 16:27; 25:31; 26:64; Mr 8:38; 14:62; Joh 1:51; Ac 1:11 1Th 4:16,17; Tit 2:13; Heb 9:28; Jude 1:14,15; Re 1:7; 20:11 his mighty angels. Gr. the angels of his power. Joh 1:3; Eph 1:2; Col 1:16; 1Pe 3:22; Re 22:6,9,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-8","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>flaming. Ge 3:24; De 4:11; 5:5; Ps 21:8,9; 50:2-6; Da 7:10; Mt 25:41,46 Heb 10:27; 12:29; 2Pe 3:7,10-12; Re 20:10,14,15; 21:8 taking. or, yielding vengeance. De 32:35,41,42; Ps 2:9-12; 94:1; Isa 61:2; 63:4-6; Heb 10:30 Re 6:10,16,17 that know. Ex 5:2; 1Sa 2:12; Ps 9:10; 79:6; Isa 27:11; Jer 9:6; Zep 1:6 Joh 3:19; 8:19; Ro 1:28; 1Co 15:34; 1Th 4:5 and that. De 4:30; Ps 18:44; Isa 1:19; Ac 6:7; Ro 1:5; 2:7,8; 6:16; 10:16; 15:18 Ro 16:26; 2Co 10:5; Ga 3:1; Heb 2:3; 5:9; 11:8; 1Pe 1:2; 3:6; 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-9","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>be. Isa 33:14; 66:24; Da 12:2; Mt 25:41,46; 26:24; Mr 9:43-49 Lu 16:25,26; Joh 5:14; Php 3:19; Heb 10:29; 2Pe 2:17; 3:7; Jude 1:13 Re 14:10,11; 20:14; 21:8; 22:15 from the presence. Ge 3:8; 4:16; Job 21:14; 22:17; Ps 16:11; 51:11; Mt 7:23; 22:13; 25:41 Lu 13:27 the glory. 2:8; De 33:2; Isa 2:10,19,21; Mt 16:27; 24:30; Tit 2:13; *Gr: Re 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-10","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>to be glorified. 12; Nu 23:23; Ps 89:7; Isa 43:21; 44:23; 49:3; 60:21; Jer 33:9 Mt 25:31; Joh 11:4; 17:10; Ga 1:24; Eph 1:6,12,14,18; 2:7; 3:10,16 1Pe 2:9; Re 7:11,12 to be admired. Ps 68:35 our. 2:13; 1Th 1:5; 2:13 in that. Mal 3:17; Mt 7:22; 24:36; Lu 10:12; 2Ti 1:12,18; 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-1-11","title":"2 Thessalonians 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>we pray. Ro 1:9; Eph 1:16; 3:14-21; Php 1:9-11; Col 1:9-13; 1Th 3:9-13 our God. Ps 48:14; 68:20; Isa 25:9; 55:7; Da 3:17; Re 5:10 would. 5; Col 1:12; Re 3:4 count. or, vouchsafe. calling. 2:14; Ro 8:30; 9:23,24; Php 3:14; 1Th 2:12; Heb 3:1; 1Pe 5:10 fulfil. Ps 138:8; Pr 4:18; Isa 66:9; Ho 6:3; Zec 4:7; Mr 4:28; 1Co 1:8 Php 1:6 the good. Ps 51:18; Lu 12:32; Eph 1:5,9; Php 2:13; 